WEBVTT

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.857
hivyo aibu ilibidi iwe yangu.

00:03:31.675 --> 00:03:33.099
Ilinichukua miaka kutambua

00:03:33.123 --> 00:03:37.034
kwamba jambo moja tu ilngeweza kuzuia mimi kubakwa,

00:03:37.058 --> 00:03:39.200
haikuwa sketi yangu,

00:03:39.224 --> 00:03:41.174
haikuwa tabasamu langu,

00:03:41.198 --> 00:03:43.394
haikuwa imani yangu ya kitoto.

00:03:43.832 --> 00:03:47.566
Kitu pekee ambacho kingeweza kuzuia kubakwa

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:49.640
ni aliyenibaka --

00:03:49.664 --> 00:03:51.677
kama angejizuia.

00:03:52.729 --> 00:03:54.840
TS: Sina kumbukumbu nzuri ya siku ya pili

00:03:55.716 --> 00:03:58.030
athari ya kileo,

00:03:58.054 --> 00:04:00.843
utupu niliojaribu kukandamiza.